{"info": {"address1": "Ugarkhurd", "address2": "District Belagavi", "city": "Belgaum", "zip": "591316", "country": "India", "phone": "91 23 3262 3717", "fax": "91 83 3927 2232", "website": "https://www.ugarsugar.com", "industry": "Confectioners", "industryKey": "confectioners", "industryDisp": "Confectioners", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "The Ugar Sugar Works Limited manufactures and sells sugar, and industrial and potable alcohol in India. The company operates through Sugar, Industrial Alcohol, Potable Alcohol, Co-Generation, and Petroleum Products Sales segments. It offers white crystal sugar and its byproducts, including bagasse, filter cake, and final molasses. The company also provides various distillery products, such as IML products under the Old Castle Premium Whisky, U.S. Whisky, U.S. Brandy, U.S. Gin, Ugar XXX Rum, Gokak Falls Whisky, Milan Whisky, Hawk Gin, and Gagarin Vodka brands; ethanol; rectified spirit; malt spirit; and extra neutral alcohol. In addition, it offers distillery byproducts comprising fermentation sludge, which is used in poultry feeds; fusel oil that is used in amyl alcohols/perfumes; and carbon dioxide for industrial purpose, as well as low grade potash. Further, it generates and distributes electricity. The company also exports its products through merchant exporters. The Ugar Sugar Works Limited was incorporated in 1939 and is based in Belgaum, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Niraj Shishir Shirgaokar B.E.", "age": 53, "title": "MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 34656000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Chandan Sanjeev Shirgaokar B.Sc., MCM", "age": 48, "title": "MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 58509000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sohan Sanjeev Shirgaokar", "age": 4